@640x480 mapdemo doubletap 320 240
@480x320 mapdemo doubletap 240 160
mapdemo wait
shot map_doubletap
mapdemo tapctl zoomout
mapdemo tapctl zoomout
mapdemo wait
shot map_zoomout_buttons
# Task 3: an online source with the network off (its saved tiles, the amber state strip), then one that needs a key
mapdemo source online
mapdemo scale 1x
mapdemo zoom 14
mapdemo offset 0 0
mapdemo wait
shot map_online_offline
mapdemo source online-key
mapdemo wait
shot map_online_nokey
